.el .ds Aq '
.TH photocraft-cli-droplet 1  "droplet " 
.SH NAME
photocraft\-cli\-droplet \- Run a droplet (File › Automate › Create Droplet) on images and folders
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBphotocraft\-cli droplet\fR [\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE.pcdroplet\fR> <\fIFILE\-OR\-DIR\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a droplet (File › Automate › Create Droplet) on images and folders
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
The folder to write the results to
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE.pcdroplet\fR>
The droplet to run
.TP
<\fIFILE\-OR\-DIR\fR>
Images and folders to run it on
